# Raw readouts are NOT committed, following the M7/M8/Q1/UQ-A/UQ-B convention:
# no raw measurement data is versioned, and every verifier recomputes from
# frozen seeds.
#
# What IS committed is sufficient to reproduce and validate them exactly:
#   candidates.jsonl             every one of the 4000 candidates with disposition
#   INTEGRITY.sha256             digests + the regeneration command
#   ../results/c1_results.json   the frozen-protocol descriptive census
#
# Regenerate with: cd experiments/c1 && C1_COLLECTION_AUTHORISED=1 node run_collection.js
readouts.jsonl
